@startuml llm_layer
title NLI Engine — LLM Layer

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

package "engine/llm" {

    class LLMClient <<dataclass, frozen>> {
        + model: str
        + api_base: str | None
        --
        + complete(messages, tools): LLMResponse
    }

    class LLMResponse <<dataclass, frozen>> {
        + text: str | None
        + tool_calls: list[ToolCall]
        + input_tokens: int
        + output_tokens: int
    }

    class ToolCall <<dataclass, frozen>> {
        + id: str
        + name: str
        + arguments: dict
    }

    class schema <<module>> {
        + {static} bound_tool_to_schema(tool: BoundTool): dict
    }

    class dispatch <<module>> {
        + {static} call_tool(tool: BoundTool, arguments: dict): str
    }

    note bottom of schema
      Mutation tools: parameters derived
      from request_model.model_json_schema().
      Read-only tools: empty parameters schema.
    end note

    note bottom of dispatch
      Branches on request_model is None
      to distinguish read-only from
      mutation tools.
    end note
}

package "engine/workflow/steps" {
    class LLMStep {
        + name: str
        + tool_names: list[str]
        - _client: LLMClient
        - _system_prompt: str
        - _max_iterations: int
        --
        + run(context, tools): (str, StepLog)
    }
}

package "engine (session layer)" {
    class BoundTool <<dataclass>> {
        + name: str
        + description: str
        + request_model: type[BaseModel] | None
        + call: Callable
    }
}

LLMResponse *-- ToolCall
LLMClient ..> LLMResponse : returns

LLMStep ..> LLMClient : calls complete()
LLMStep ..> schema : uses
LLMStep ..> dispatch : uses

schema ..> BoundTool : reads
dispatch ..> BoundTool : executes

note right of LLMClient
  Thin LiteLLM wrapper.
  Provider is encoded in the model
  identifier: "ollama/qwen3.5:4b",
  "gpt-4o", "anthropic/claude-...".
  api_base overrides the default
  endpoint (required for Ollama).
end note

note right of LLMStep
  Agentic loop: calls complete(),
  dispatches tool calls, repeats
  until no tool calls remain.
  Persists all intermediate messages
  into context.history.
  Aggregates token counts across
  all iterations into one StepLog.
end note

@enduml
